{"id":"465149","name":"虫草三鲜汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/465149/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"海参","amount":"2条"},{"name":"急冻鲍鱼","amount":"3个"},{"name":"花胶","amount":"120g"},{"name":"猪扇骨","amount":"500g"},{"name":"虫草","amount":"6克"},{"name":"姬松茸","amount":"60g"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"急冻鲍鱼解冻，刷洗干净周边和底部的黑膜。","img":"images/465149/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把鲍鱼，海参，花胶飞水去腥。(海参，花胶预先已泡发好。)","img":"images/465149/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪扇骨飞水，洗去浮沫。","img":"images/465149/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"虫草洗一下。","img":"images/465149/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"姬松茸泡洗干净。","img":"images/465149/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"海参切块。","img":"images/465149/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"花胶切块。","img":"images/465149/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把材料放入汤锅，大火烧开，转小火煲2-3小时。","img":"images/465149/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煲好，放盐调味。","img":"images/465149/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"滋补养颜。","img":"images/465149/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}